Package: ARSPI
Type: Package
Title: ARSPI - A Tool for Estimating AutoRegressive SPI and Drought Characteristics
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Soham", "Ghosh", email = "phd2001161004@iiti.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to estimate the AutoRegressive Standardized Precipitation Index (ARSPI) using a Bayesian hierarchical model with MCMC via JAGS. Includes functions to classify and analyze drought characteristics (mild, moderate, severe, extreme) and supports custom prior specification. Useful for hydroclimatic risk analysis and drought monitoring at different time scales.
